{"channelId":"UCsdIECMZvVvQ8_4qG1_LK5Q","row":["PetAbility Podcast",449,"This is a must-hear podcast for pet owners wanting access to the latest in pet quality of life and longevity. Whether your pet has fur, feathers, scales or shells, Cathy and Chris believe in treating your pet as a whole, both mind and body. Continuing a collaboration that began in 2003, Cathy and Chris share the gift of gab as well as their network in the pet rehab community. Using their vast expertise as Certified Canine Rehabilitation Practitioners (CCRPs), Cathy Symons CVT, CCRP, and Chris Cranston MPT, CCRP, offer relevant information and provocative interviews on their podcast, PetAbility. With an emphasis on mobility and independence, their show is about improving function, restoring confidence, alleviating fear, providing mental stimulation, and easing pain to help your pets live their best lives.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsdIECMZvVvQ8_4qG1_LK5Q","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsdIECMZvVvQ8_4qG1_LK5Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:54.394Z","channelId":"UCsdIECMZvVvQ8_4qG1_LK5Q","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"55f81093426bc82ea97b0fe6640f670fa41101412107d394d1ed20d83880de7f","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"ce4e367f5a524c1d997985518c04f6f8ba4d7c0d05a5f85f5551a1e91f741ff9"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsdIECMZvVvQ8_4qG1_LK5Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:54.394Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsdIECMZvVvQ8_4qG1_LK5Q","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":449,"raw":"449 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsdIECMZvVvQ8_4qG1_LK5Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:54.394Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"recurring_cont